      en: ["Built around 1820", "Height: 12 meters", "Material: coral stone", "Abandoned in 1866", "Roof destroyed by hurricanes", "Flagpole base excavated in 2000"],
      es: ["Construida hacia 1820", "Altura: 12 metros", "Material: Piedra caliza de coral", "Abandonada en 1866", "Techo destruido por huracanes", "Cimiento del asta de bandera excavado en 2000"],
